{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-luk-11-1","title":"Luke 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ teaches us to pray, and that instantly; 11 assuring us that God will give all good things to them that ask him. 14 He, casting out a dumb devil, rebukes the blasphemous Pharisees; 27 and shows who are blessed; 29 preaches to the people; 37 and reprehends the outward shew of holiness in the Pharisees, scribes, and lawyers.</p>\n<p>that. 6:12; 9:18,28; 22:39-45; Heb 5:7 teach. Ps 10:17; 19:14; Ro 8:26,27; Jas 4:2,3; Jude 1:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-2","title":"Luke 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>When. Ec 5:2; Ho 14:2; Mt 6:6-8 Our. Isa 63:16; Mt 6:9-15; Ro 1:7; 8:15; 1Co 1:3; 2Co 1:2; Ga 1:4; Eph 1:2 Php 1:2; 4:20; Col 1:2; 1Th 1:1,3; 3:11-13; 2Th 1:1,2; 2:16 which. 2Ch 20:6; Ps 11:4; Ec 5:2; Da 2:28; Mt 5:16; 10:32 Hallowed. Le 10:3; 22:23; 1Ki 8:43; 2Ki 19:19; Ps 57:11; 72:18,19; 108:5 Eze 36:23; Hab 2:14; Re 15:4 Thy kingdom. 10:9-11; Isa 2:2-5; Da 2:44; 7:18,27; Re 11:15; 19:6; 20:4 Thy will. Ps 103:20; Isa 6:2,3; Mt 6:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-3","title":"Luke 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Give. Ex 16:15-22; Pr 30:8; Isa 33:16; Mt 6:11,34; Joh 6:27-33 day by day. or, for the day.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-4","title":"Luke 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>forgive us. 1Ki 8:34,36; Ps 25:11,18; 32:1-5; 51:1-3; 130:3,4; Isa 43:25,26 Da 9:19; Ho 14:2; Mt 6:12; 1Jo 1:8-10 for. Mt 6:14,15; 11:25,26; 18:35; Eph 4:31,32; Col 3:13; Jas 2:13 lead. 8:13; 22:46; Mt 6:13; 26:41; 1Co 10:13; 2Co 12:7,8; Re 2:10; 3:10 but. Ge 48:16; Ps 121:7; Joh 17:15; 2Th 3:3; 2Ti 4:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-5","title":"Luke 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>18:1-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-6","title":"Luke 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>in his journey. or, out of his way. 6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-7","title":"Luke 11:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Trouble. 7:6; Ga 6:17 the door. 13:25; Mt 25:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-8","title":"Luke 11:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>because of. 18:1-8; Ge 32:26; Mt 15:22-28; Ro 15:30; 2Co 12:8; Col 2:1; 4:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-9","title":"Luke 11:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>I say. 13:24; Mt 6:29; 21:31; Mr 13:37; Re 2:24 Ask. Ps 50:15; 118:5; Jer 33:3; Mt 7:7,8; 21:22; Mr 11:24; Joh 4:10; 14:13 Joh 15:7,16; 16:23,24; 2Co 12:8,9; Heb 4:16; Jas 1:5; 5:15; 1Jo 3:22 1Jo 5:14,15 seek. 13:24; Ps 27:4,8; 34:4,10; 105:3,4; So 3:1-4; 5:6; Isa 45:19; 55:6,7 Jer 29:12; Da 9:3; Am 5:4-6; Joh 1:45-49; Ac 10:4-6; Ro 2:7 Heb 11:6 knock. 13:25; 2Co 6:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-10","title":"Luke 11:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>18:1; Ps 31:22; La 3:8,18,54-58; Jon 2:2-8; Jas 4:3; 5:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-11","title":"Luke 11:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>a son. Isa 49:15; Mt 7:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-12","title":"Luke 11:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>offer. Gr. give. a scorpion. 10:19; Eze 2:6; Re 9:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-13","title":"Luke 11:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>being. Ge 6:5,6; 8:21; Job 15:14-16; Ps 51:5; Joh 3:5,6; Ro 7:18; Tit 3:3 know. Isa 49:15; Mt 7:11; Heb 12:9,10 how. Mt 6:30; Ro 5:9,10,17; 8:32; 2Co 3:9-11 heavenly. 2; 15:30-32; Mt 5:16,45; 6:14,32 give the. Pr 1:23; Isa 44:3,4; Eze 36:27; Joe 2:28; Mt 7:11; Joh 4:10; 7:37-39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-14","title":"Luke 11:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Mt 9:32,33; 12:22,23; Mr 7:32-37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-15","title":"Luke 11:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>He. Mt 9:34; 12:24-30; Mr 3:22-30; Joh 7:20; 8:48,52; 10:20 Beelzebub. Gr. Beelzebul. and so. 18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-16","title":"Luke 11:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Mt 12:38,39; 16:1-4; Mr 8:11,12; Joh 6:30; 1Co 1:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-17","title":"Luke 11:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>knowing. Mt 9:4; 12:25; Mr 3:23-26; Joh 2:25; Re 2:23 Every. 2Ch 10:16-19; 13:16,17; Isa 9:20,21; 19:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-18","title":"Luke 11:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Satan. Mt 12:26 ye say. 15; Mt 12:31-34; Jas 3:5-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-19","title":"Luke 11:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>by. 9:49; Mt 12:27,28 shall. 31,32; 19:22; Job 15:6; Mt 12:41,42; Ro 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-20","title":"Luke 11:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>the finger. Ex 8:19; Mt 12:28 the kingdom.For the destruction of the kingdom of Satan plainly implies the setting up of the kingdom of God. The reasoning of the Pharisees (ver. 17, and Mt 12:24, 25,) was not expressed, and Jesus knowing their thoughts, gave ample proof of his omniscience. This, with our Lord's masterly confutation of their reasonings, by a conclusion drawn from their own premises, one would have supposed might have humbled and convinced those men; but the most conclusive reasoning, and the most astonishing miracles, were lost upon a people who were obstinately determined to disbelieve every thing that was good relative to Jesus of Nazareth.</p>\n<p>10:9,11; Da 2:44; Ac 20:25; 28:23-28; 2Th 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-21","title":"Luke 11:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Mt 12:29; Mr 3:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-22","title":"Luke 11:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Ge 3:15; Isa 27:1; 49:24,25; 53:12; 63:1-4; Col 2:15; 1Jo 3:8; 4:4 Re 20:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-23","title":"Luke 11:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>9:50; Mt 12:30; Re 3:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-24","title":"Luke 11:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>the unclean. Mt 12:43-45 he walketh. Job 1:7; 2:2; 1Pe 5:8 dry. Jud 6:37-40; Ps 63:1; Isa 35:1,2,7; 41:17-19; 44:3; Eze 47:8-11 Eph 2:2 seeking. Pr 4:16; Isa 48:22; 57:20,21 I will. Mr 5:10; 9:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-25","title":"Luke 11:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>he findeth. 2Ch 24:17-22; Ps 36:3; 81:11,12; 125:5; Mt 12:44,45; 2Th 2:9-12 2Pe 2:10-19; Jude 1:8-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-26","title":"Luke 11:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>more. Mt 23:15 and the. Zep 1:6; Mt 12:45; Joh 5:14; Heb 6:4-8; 10:26-31; 2Pe 2:20-22 1Jo 5:16; Jude 1:12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-27","title":"Luke 11:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>Blessed. 1:28,42,48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-28","title":"Luke 11:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>6:47,48; 8:21; Ps 1:1-3; 112:1; 119:1-6; 128:1; Isa 48:17,18 Mt 7:21-25; 12:48-50; Joh 13:17; Jas 1:21-25; 1Jo 3:21-24; Re 22:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-29","title":"Luke 11:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>when. 12:1; 14:25,26 This is. 50; 9:41; Isa 57:3,4; Mt 3:7; 23:34-36; Mr 8:38; Joh 8:44; Ac 7:51,52 they. Mt 12:38,39; 16:1-4; Mr 8:11,12; Joh 2:18; 6:30; 1Co 1:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-30","title":"Luke 11:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>24:46,47; Jon 1:17; 2:10; 3:2-10; Mt 12:40-42</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-31","title":"Luke 11:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>queen. 1Ki 10:1,2-13; 2Ch 9:1; Mt 12:42 rise. Isa 54:17; Jer 3:11; Ro 2:27; Heb 11:7 a greater. 3:22; 9:35; Isa 9:6,7; Col 1:15-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-32","title":"Luke 11:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>men. Jon 3:5-10 a greater. Jon 1:2,3; 4:1-4,9; Heb 7:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-33","title":"Luke 11:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>when. 8:16,17; Mt 5:15; Mr 4:21,22 a bushel. Mt 5:15 may see. Mt 5:16; 10:27; Joh 11:9; 12:46; Php 2:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-34","title":"Luke 11:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>light of. Ps 119:18; Mt 6:22,23; Mr 8:18; Ac 26:18; Eph 1:17 single. Ac 2:46; 2Co 1:12; 11:3; Eph 6:5; Col 3:22 but. Ge 19:11; 2Ki 6:15-20; Ps 81:12; Pr 28:22; Isa 6:10; 29:10; 42:19 Isa 44:18; Jer 5:21; Mr 4:12; 7:22; Ac 13:11; Ro 11:8-10; 2Co 4:4 2Th 2:9-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-35","title":"Luke 11:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>Pr 16:25; 26:12; Isa 5:20,21; Jer 8:8,9; Joh 7:48,49; 9:39-41 Ro 1:22; 2:19-23; 1Co 1:19-21; 3:18-20; Jas 3:13-17; 2Pe 1:9; 2:18 Re 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-36","title":"Luke 11:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>the whole. Ps 119:97-105; Pr 1:5; 2:1-11; 4:18,19; 6:23; 20:27; Isa 8:20; 42:16 Ho 6:3; Mt 13:11,12,52; Mr 4:24,25; 2Co 4:6; Eph 4:14; Col 3:16 2Ti 3:15-17; Heb 5:14; Jas 1:25; 2Pe 3:18 the bright shining of a candle. Gr. a candle by its brightshining.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-37","title":"Luke 11:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>7:36; 14:1; 1Co 9:19-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-38","title":"Luke 11:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>he marvelled. Mt 15:2,3; Mr 7:2-5; Joh 3:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-39","title":"Luke 11:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>Now. Mt 23:25; Ga 1:14; 2Ti 3:5; Tit 1:15 but. 16:15; Ge 6:5; 2Ch 25:2; 31:20,21; Pr 26:25; 30:12; Jer 4:14 Mt 12:33-35; 15:19; Joh 12:6; 13:2; Ac 5:3; 8:21-23; Jas 4:8 ravening. Ps 22:13; Eze 22:25,27; Zep 3:3; Mt 7:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-40","title":"Luke 11:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>fools. 12:20; 24:25; Ps 14:1; 75:4,5; 94:8; Pr 1:22; 8:5; Jer 5:21; Mt 23:17 Mt 23:26; 1Co 15:36 did. Ge 1:26; 2:7; Nu 16:22; Ps 33:15; 94:9; Zec 12:1; Heb 12:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-41","title":"Luke 11:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>rather. 12:33; 14:12-14; 16:9; 18:22; 19:8; De 15:8-10; Job 13:16-20; Ps 41:1 Ps 112:9; Pr 14:31; 19:17; Ec 11:1,2; Isa 58:7-11; Da 4:27; Mt 5:42 Mt 6:1-4; 25:34-40; 26:11; Ac 9:36-39; 10:31,32; 11:29; 24:17 2Co 8:7-9,12; 9:6-15; Eph 4:28; Heb 6:10; 13:16; Jas 1:27; 2:14-16 1Jo 3:16,17 of such things as ye have. or, as you are able. all. Ac 10:15; Ro 14:14-18; 1Ti 4:4,5; Tit 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-42","title":"Luke 11:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>woe. Mt 23:13,23,27 for. 18:12 and pass. De 10:12,13; 1Sa 15:22; Pr 21:3; Isa 1:10-17; 58:2-6; Jer 7:2-10 Jer 7:21,22; Mic 6:8; Mal 1:6; 2:17; Joh 5:42; Tit 2:11,12; 1Jo 4:20 and not. Le 27:30-33; 2Ch 31:5-10; Ne 10:37; Ec 7:18; Mal 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-43","title":"Luke 11:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>for. 14:7-11; 20:46; Pr 16:18; Mt 23:6; Mr 12:38,39; Ro 12:10; Php 2:3 Jas 2:2-4; 3Jo 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-44","title":"Luke 11:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>for. Nu 19:16; Ps 5:9; Ho 9:8; Mt 23:27,28; Ac 23:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-45","title":"Luke 11:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>thou. 1Ki 22:8; Jer 6:10; 20:8; Am 7:10-13; Joh 7:7,48; 9:40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-46","title":"Luke 11:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>Woe. Isa 10:1; Mt 23:2-4; Ga 6:13 ye yourselves. Isa 58:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-47","title":"Luke 11:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>for. Mt 23:29-33; Ac 7:51; 1Th 2:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-48","title":"Luke 11:48","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":48,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":48},"content":"<p>ye bear. Jos 24:22; Job 15:6; Ps 64:8; Eze 18:19 for. 2Ch 36:16; Mt 21:35-38; Heb 11:35-38; Jas 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-49","title":"Luke 11:49","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":49,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":49},"content":"<p>the wisdom.Probably by the Wisdom of God we are to understand the [logos ,] or Word of God, that is, our Lord himself; this being a dignified and oriental mode of expression for I say, as it is in the parallel passage.</p>\n<p>Pr 1:2-6; 8:1-12; 9:1-3; 1Co 1:30; Col 2:3 I will. 24:47; Mt 23:34; Ac 1:8; Eph 4:11 and some. 21:16,17; Mt 22:6; Joh 16:2; Ac 7:57-60; 8:1,3; 9:1,2; 12:1,2; 22:4,5 Ac 22:20; 26:10,11; 2Co 11:24,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-50","title":"Luke 11:50","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":50,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":50},"content":"<p>the blood. Ge 9:5,6; Nu 35:33; 2Ki 24:4; Ps 9:12; Isa 26:21; Re 18:20-24 may. Ex 20:5; Jer 7:29; 51:56</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-51","title":"Luke 11:51","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":51,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":51},"content":"<p>the blood of Abel. Ge 4:8-11; Heb 11:4; 12:24; 1Jo 3:12 Zacharias. 2Ch 24:20-22; Zec 1:1; Mt 23:35 It shall. Jer 7:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-52","title":"Luke 11:52","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":52,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":52},"content":"<p>for. 19:39,40; Mal 2:7; Mt 23:13; Joh 7:47-52; 9:24-34; Ac 4:17,18; 5:40 hindered. or, forbad.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-53","title":"Luke 11:53","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":53,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":53},"content":"<p>to urge. Ps 22:12,13; Isa 9:12 to speak. 20:20,27; Jer 18:18; 20:10; 1Co 13:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-11-54","title":"Luke 11:54","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":54,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":54},"content":"<p>seeking. Ps 37:32,33; 56:5,6; Mt 22:15,18,35; Mr 12:13</p>"}]}